    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You follow a small group of friends brought together by a shared mission: to find someone they\u2019ve lost. As they search across Haifa\u2019s streets, homes, and hidden corners, they\u2019ll confront not only external obstacles, but also their own emotional scars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.poster.avif?t=1754915321\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.webm?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.mp4?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each richly illustrated scene, you\u2019ll uncover objects that hold personal meaning for the characters. Some offer comfort, others trigger painful memories. These items don\u2019t just move the story forward\u2014they shape the mental state of the people you\u2019re travelling with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By helping them find moments of hope, joy, and connection, you\u2019ll keep them grounded in a world that threatens to pull them under.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.poster.avif?t=1754915321\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.webm?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.mp4?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Hidden Object Gameplay</strong> <br>Objects you find reveal narrative clues, unlock memories, start conversations, and move the story forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope as a Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Each discovery impacts your group\u2019s mental state, affecting their ability to cope with the journey ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich with Visual Novel Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Uncover a quiet mystery through emotional dialogue, reflective thoughts, and evolving relationships within a diverse cast of characters shaped by conflict and connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Painted Visuals </strong>\u2013 A visually distinctive, thoughtfully hand-drawn style that captures the beauty and melancholy of everyday moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/26dce4f4015fa47700b16204cb4fd3d2.poster.avif?t=1754915321\" width=344 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/26dce4f4015fa47700b16204cb4fd3d2.webm?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/26dce4f4015fa47700b16204cb4fd3d2.mp4?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You follow a small group of friends brought together by a shared mission: to find someone they\u2019ve lost. As they search across Haifa\u2019s streets, homes, and hidden corners, they\u2019ll confront not only external obstacles, but also their own emotional scars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.poster.avif?t=1754915321\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.webm?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.mp4?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each richly illustrated scene, you\u2019ll uncover objects that hold personal meaning for the characters. Some offer comfort, others trigger painful memories. These items don\u2019t just move the story forward\u2014they shape the mental state of the people you\u2019re travelling with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By helping them find moments of hope, joy, and connection, you\u2019ll keep them grounded in a world that threatens to pull them under.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.poster.avif?t=1754915321\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.webm?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.mp4?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Hidden Object Gameplay</strong> <br>Objects you find reveal narrative clues, unlock memories, start conversations, and move the story forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope as a Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Each discovery impacts your group\u2019s mental state, affecting their ability to cope with the journey ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich with Visual Novel Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Uncover a quiet mystery through emotional dialogue, reflective thoughts, and evolving relationships within a diverse cast of characters shaped by conflict and connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Painted Visuals </strong>\u2013 A visually distinctive, thoughtfully hand-drawn style that captures the beauty and melancholy of everyday moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/26dce4f4015fa47700b16204cb4fd3d2.poster.avif?t=1754915321\" width=344 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/26dce4f4015fa47700b16204cb4fd3d2.webm?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/26dce4f4015fa47700b16204cb4fd3d2.mp4?t=1754915321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Haifa is a hidden object puzzle experience that tells a story about the emotional struggles of trying to maintain hopefulness in times of war. Help your characters keep their head up by finding small objects in their environment to lift their spirits, as they look for their lost friend.",
